{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17111310","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17111310","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1711131001:1":{"text":"结束了……至少这一刻，天空不再被阴影遮蔽。女神，我们已经赢了吗？","source_cn":"结束了……至少这一刻，天空不再被阴影遮蔽。女神，我们已...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8651685EA71CE218","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1711131002:0":{"text":"看啊，罗兰。尘埃虽已落定，但伊索米亚深处的震颤从未停歇，我们的光亮仍旧无法照进那最深处。","source_cn":"看啊，罗兰。尘埃虽已落定，但伊索米亚深处的震颤从未停歇...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF1F64E39A604D3DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1711131003:0":{"text":"那意图吞噬万物的恶意，依然盘踞在不可触及的深渊之底。","source_cn":"那意图吞噬万物的恶意，依然盘踞在不可触及的深渊之底。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5B2A32404587B5B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1711131004:0":{"text":"它在黑暗中磨砺爪牙，在静默中编织下一次足以毁灭伊索米亚的黑潮。","source_cn":"它在黑暗中磨砺爪牙，在静默中编织下一次足以毁灭伊索米亚...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB63F46F5DF43BDAF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1711131005:1":{"text":"看来这艰苦卓绝的抗争，还远远没有到谢幕的时候。","source_cn":"看来这艰苦卓绝的抗争，还远远没有到谢幕的时候。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE3574ED0FA307D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1711131006:0":{"text":"这本就是一场永无止境的远征。但伊索米亚已经获得了最宝贵的喘息之机。","source_cn":"这本就是一场永无止境的远征。但伊索米亚已经获得了最宝贵...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x744015DD1E698A90","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1711131007:0":{"text":"不要松懈，罗兰。在那深渊彻底苏醒前，去建立起足以守护凡人的国度吧，让光芒驱散他们的恐惧……","source_cn":"不要松懈，罗兰。在那深渊彻底苏醒前，去建立起足以守护凡...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB55AA39D35589628","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:9:1711131008:1":{"text":"时光荏苒，耀光帝国逐渐强大。然而，凡人的光阴在神明眼中不过须臾……","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x988D111CEE4CA865","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1711131009:1":{"text":"罗兰……好久不见。","source_cn":"罗兰……好久不见。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x11C36DD221EA5109","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1711131010:1":{"text":"女神，您曾让我建立守护凡人的国度，如今它已初具轮廓。但我作为凡人的旅程，似乎也走到了某个边界。","source_cn":"女神，您曾让我建立守护凡人的国度，如今它已初具轮廓。但...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B708580A29D2BD3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1711131011:1":{"text":"这柄承载着您意志的剑太过沉重。以我这具凡人之躯，已经无法再为这个国家挥舞它了。","source_cn":"这柄承载着您意志的剑太过沉重。以我这具凡人之躯，已经无...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8098F49C1F921C04","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1711131012:1":{"text":"你以凡人的血肉之躯，创造了连神明也为之侧目的奇迹。对此——","source_cn":"你以凡人的血肉之躯，创造了连神明也为之侧目的奇迹。对此——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x91F35C574938B1CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1711131013:1":{"text":"我以生命女神之名，邀你踏入永恒的领域——褪去凡人的桎梏，作为半神，与我一同俯瞰你所守护的大地。","source_cn":"我以生命女神之名，邀你踏入永恒的领域——褪去凡人的桎梏...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D21B5770585339D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1711131014:1":{"text":"如果可以顺从私心，我本愿在使命终结后回归尘土。但耀光帝国如同初生的婴孩……","source_cn":"如果可以顺从私心，我本愿在使命终结后回归尘土。但耀光帝...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7E7F3B1904996301","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1711131015:1":{"text":"如果您愿意赋予我继续陪伴它的特权，我将接下这份永恒的责任。","source_cn":"如果您愿意赋予我继续陪伴它的特权，我将接下这份永恒的责任。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A86FF67AF4B8E38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1711131016:1":{"text":"既然你将以半神的姿态隐于幕后，那么凡世的王座，你选好继任者了吗？","source_cn":"既然你将以半神的姿态隐于幕后，那么凡世的王座，你选好继...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x50D6DCD0C890BBAB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1711131017:1":{"text":"我拒绝行使这项权利，女神。","source_cn":"我拒绝行使这项权利，女神。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE7150B8ECCA2484B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1711131018:1":{"text":"为何？","source_cn":"为何？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC917B55BD15D3199","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1711131019:1":{"text":"我终究是从凡人走来，我深知人类的贪婪、短视与多变。凡人的眼界不及神明，我无法保证自己选出的人，能永远做出正确的决定。","source_cn":"我终究是从凡人走来，我深知人类的贪婪、短视与多变。凡人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x833345709DB7BCE7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1711131020:1":{"text":"所以，我将这个选择权交还给您，交还给不朽的神明。","source_cn":"所以，我将这个选择权交还给您，交还给不朽的神明。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCFEABC37AE9029CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1711131021:1":{"text":"你总是这么谨慎而清醒。既然你不愿独断未来，那就让<style=\"highlight\">命运</style>来挑选吧。","source_cn":"你总是这么谨慎而清醒。既然你不愿独断未来，那就让<st...","